
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>My Website</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial;
            background-color: #fce4ec;
            text-align: center;
            margin: 0;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #ad1457;
            color: white;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #ad1457;
        }

        p {
            font-size: 18px;
        }

        button {
            background-color: #ad1457;
            color: white;
            padding: 12px 25px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #ad1457;
            color: white;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 50px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>Welcome to My Website</h1>
        <p>My First Website Using HTML and CSS</p>
    </header>

    <h2>About Us</h2>
    <p>Welcome to my website. This is my first web project.</p>

    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <p>Web Designing</p>
    <p>HTML and CSS</p>
    <p>Website Development</p>

    <button>Learn More</button>

    <footer>
        <p>© 2026 My Website | All Rights Reserved</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
